                                             od
The sub-indicators are Cultural Activities Numbers (CAN) and Inclusiveness (INC).
                        众

   A higher quantity of cultural activities indicates that the building holds greater cul-
tural signiﬁcance and contributes to the development of local culture. Inclusivity is
                                           Hm
measured by the number of tourists from different countries. The more diverse the
                 公



tourists a building attracts, the broader its cultural inﬂuence is considered, facilitat-
