9 Strengths and Weaknesses

9.1   Strengths
   • Our underwriting decision model takes into account the real needs of insurance
     companies, making decisions driven by proﬁt to ensure the long-term health of




                                                        型
     the insurance company. It also allocates the premiums received by the insurance
     company reasonably, considering the reinsurance decisions for risk diversiﬁca-




                                                      模
     tion.
   • By using a large number of samples in the Monte Carlo simulation, it realisti-
     cally replicates the actual insurance scenarios, resulting in high credibility of the




                                                     学
     outcomes.
   • Our underwriting decision model separately considers and calculates internal
     and external risks, allowing for a more comprehensive assessment of a policy’s




                                                   数
     risk.
   • We provide targeted protection measures for buildings of different protection
     levels, ensuring that the intensity of protection is matched with the cost and value
                                                ：
